| !Run for !ClawsMail - Claws Mail, an email client, on RISC OS
| A UnixLib program converted to Absolute (AIF), statically linked with GTK
| 3.24.41 and riscos-gtk's RISC OS GDK backend: it needs SharedUnixLibrary,
| ARMEABISupport and Iconv (PackMan). It runs as a normal Wimp task.
Set ClawsMail$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <ClawsMail$Dir>.!Sprites
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Claws Mail needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Claws Mail needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad <ClawsMail$Dir>.PThrTicker
| Secure connections (TLS: pop3s, smtps, STARTTLS): RISC OS's AcornSSL
| module (RISC OS 5.28 or later)
RMEnsure AcornSSL 0 IfThere System:Modules.Network.URL.AcornSSL Then RMLoad System:Modules.Network.URL.AcornSSL
RMEnsure AcornSSL 0 Error Claws Mail needs the AcornSSL module (RISC OS 5.28 or later) for secure connections.
| Settings (and the mailbox, unless you choose another place when Claws
| Mail first starts) go in Choices.
IfThere <Choices$Write> Then Set ClawsMail$Choices <Choices$Write>.ClawsMail Else Set ClawsMail$Choices <ClawsMail$Dir>.Choices
CDir <ClawsMail$Choices>
| The font cache and the Log go in the scrap directory.
CDir <Wimp$ScrapDir>.ClawsMail
| fontconfig keeps its cache here (fonts/fonts.conf names it): make it
| now, as fontconfig may not manage to on RISC OS
CDir <Wimp$ScrapDir>.ClawsMail.fontcache
| The WimpSlot holds the program; the C heap grows it as needed (no
| dynamic area, so no logical address space is reserved).
WimpSlot -min @SLOT@K -max @SLOT@K
| A file dropped on the application (or given here) is attached to a new
| message.
Run <ClawsMail$Dir>.claws-mail %*0
